version: 2
updates:
  - package-ecosystem: npm
    directory: "/"
    schedule:
      interval: weekly
    open-pull-requests-limit: 5
    groups:
      minor-and-patch:
        update-types: ["minor", "patch"]
  - package-ecosystem: github-actions
    directory: "/"
    schedule:
      interval: weekly

## What does this change?

## Checklist

- [ ] `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm test`, `npm run build` all pass
- [ ] New data sources are official/public, attributed in NOTICE.md and the About page
- [ ] Derived or interpolated data is labelled as such in the UI
- [ ] Interactive elements are keyboard-accessible with text labels (not colour-only)
